WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.770
<b>Oobi</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.770
<b>Eihou Academy</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.770
<b>Eihou Academy</b>

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.770
Wait, 2-0? And Eihou's only had one hit?

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:07.380
What's going on here?

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:12.350
Oobi Middle is a public school that
always loses in the first or second round.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:17.030
Does this mean Oobi's got a good pitcher?

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.330
Strike!

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:25.540
Their starting pitcher's 
 small but that's fast.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.960
That isn't their starting pitcher.
That's the reliever.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.260
Their first pitcher is
the guy playing shortstop.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:38.220
He also has a fastball that's no joke, 
and he didn't give up a run in three innings.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:42.180
With that catcher who got two RBIs,

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:48.180
those three make up an elite trio who used to
play with Yayoi and Tao on Yokohama Little.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.150
What?

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:51.610
You're out!

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:53.980
An elite trio from Yokohama Little?

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.320
Wouldn't they usually
join a local hardball team?

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.440
Why are they playing
middle school rubber-ball?

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:05.180
Did you notice the <i>other</i> thing
on the scoreboard, Daigo?

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.730
Check out the name of Oobi's 2-hole.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Oobi</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Idemitsu</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Mayumura</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Seko</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Uozumi</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Hayazaka</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Haneda</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Miura</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Yamamuro</b>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Kouda</b>

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:13.920
<b>Mayumura</b>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.590
<b>Mayumura</b>

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.590
M-Michiru-chan?!

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:26.480
I didn't expect us to have such
a tough game in the prelims.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:35.200
<i>Batting second, pitcher, Mayumura-san.</i>

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:38.950
First!

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.030
Out!

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:45.500
<i>Batting third, shortstop, Seko-kun.</i>

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.710
Yeah, nice!

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:54.670
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Uozumi-kun.</i>

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.550
<i>This is ridiculous.</i>

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:59.390
<i>They're swinging at my
pitches like they're nothing.</i>

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:01.350
<i>Who the hell...</i>

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.180
<i>...are these guys?!</i>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.030
Those four jus' beat Eihou by themselves.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.490
It really isn't a surprise they beat Eihou.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.250
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.250
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.250
<b>Oobi</b>

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.720
Turns out we're playing
Oobi Middle, not Eihou.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:05.010
<b>Torn Feelings</b>

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.680
They defeated Eihou, so they're
a strong team, no doubt about it.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:09.860
But we also got this far in our
very first tournament on merit.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:14.640
If we keep on believing and don't get
intimidated, we have a shot at winning.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:16.360
Let's win this and go to regionals!

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.780
<i>On defense for Oobi Middle:</i>

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.240
<i>Pitcher, Seko-kun.</i>

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.950
<i>Catcher, Uozumi-kun.</i>

